# Repo-root ignores. Module-level build output and secrets are handled by the
# nested api/.gitignore - a .gitignore only applies to its own directory and
# below, which is why the root-level IDE folders need this file too.

### IDE ###
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vscode/

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Logs ###
*.log